---
import Arrow from "./Arrow.astro";
const a = "url(#eco-arrow)";
---
<figure class="diagram">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 760 385" role="img" aria-label="How health records move in ABDM: a clinic asks for consent through ABDM, the patient approves in their ABHA app, and the hospital sends encrypted records to the clinic">
    <Arrow id="eco-arrow" />
    <g class="line">
      <path d="M530 82 L487 150" marker-end={a} />
      <path d="M285 195 H212" marker-end={a} />
      <path d="M487 240 L530 298" marker-end={a} />
      <path d="M637 250 V132" marker-end={a} />
    </g>
    <rect class="box" x="20" y="150" width="190" height="90" rx="10" />
    <text class="title" x="36" y="180">Patient</text>
    <text class="sub" x="36" y="204">approves or refuses in</text>
    <text class="sub" x="36" y="222">their ABHA app</text>

    <rect class="accent" x="285" y="135" width="200" height="120" rx="10" />
    <text class="title" x="301" y="168">ABDM</text>
    <text class="sub" x="301" y="192">gateway and consent</text>
    <text class="sub" x="301" y="210">manager; it never sees</text>
    <text class="sub" x="301" y="228">the records</text>

    <rect class="box" x="530" y="20" width="215" height="112" rx="10" />
    <text class="title" x="546" y="48">HIU</text>
    <text class="sub" x="546" y="72">health information user,</text>
    <text class="sub" x="546" y="90">e.g. a clinic you</text>
    <text class="sub" x="546" y="108">visit next</text>

    <rect class="box" x="530" y="250" width="215" height="112" rx="10" />
    <text class="title" x="546" y="280">HIP</text>
    <text class="sub" x="546" y="304">health information</text>
    <text class="sub" x="546" y="322">provider, e.g. a hospital</text>
    <text class="sub" x="546" y="340">you visited</text>

    <g>
      <circle class="badge" cx="509" cy="116" r="12" /><text class="badge-text" x="509" y="121" text-anchor="middle">1</text>
      <circle class="badge" cx="248" cy="195" r="12" /><text class="badge-text" x="248" y="200" text-anchor="middle">2</text>
      <circle class="badge" cx="509" cy="269" r="12" /><text class="badge-text" x="509" y="274" text-anchor="middle">3</text>
      <circle class="badge" cx="637" cy="191" r="12" /><text class="badge-text" x="637" y="196" text-anchor="middle">4</text>
    </g>
  </svg>
  <figcaption>How a health record moves in ABDM. The numbers match the steps below.</figcaption>
</figure>
